<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 04.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 04.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire and Nottinghamshire Feb 111.00 Mar 112.00</p>
<p>Stockport Feb 115.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Liverpool Feb 97.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Feb 95.50 Mar 96.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Feb 95.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Feb 98.00 Apr/Jun 100.00</p>
<p>Avon range Feb 98.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Feb 99.50</p>
</text>
